# follow: ArduCopter parameters shared by SITL and the drone (ArduCopter 4.6 or newer).
# Board-specific serial settings live in their own file.

# Mode switch on RC channel 6 (ELRS channel 5 is the 2-position arm switch).
# 3-position switch: ALT_HOLD (PWM <= 1230), LOITER (1491-1620), GUIDED (>= 1750). Positions 2, 3
# and 5 repeat their neighbours so a PWM between detents never selects an unexpected mode.
FLTMODE_CH 6
FLTMODE1 2
FLTMODE2 2
FLTMODE3 5
FLTMODE4 5
FLTMODE5 4
FLTMODE6 4

# Stop if setpoints stop arriving for 3 s (follow_app sends them at 20 Hz while engaged).
GUID_TIMEOUT 3

# Backstop against a runaway follow: max altitude 30 m, 50 m circle around home, RTL on breach.
FENCE_ENABLE 1
FENCE_TYPE 3
FENCE_RADIUS 50
FENCE_ALT_MAX 30
FENCE_ACTION 1
